cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Counterentry: a knowledge structure that notices when it stops being true"
version: "3"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21924843
date-released: 2026-10-06
authors:
  - family-names: "Pollock"
    given-names: "Chris"
abstract: >-
  A specification for keeping records that people and AI assistants act on.
  Every load-bearing claim is paired with a second, independent record of the
  same fact, and the system reports the pairs that no longer agree. Version 3
  adds six weeks of field notes from a daily personal deployment.
keywords:
  - knowledge management
  - LLM agents
  - verification
  - personal assistant
  - LLM wiki
